  kind: 1
  title: "\u0110\xEAm nh\xE0 \u2014 ng\xE0y 8 (th\u01B0 gi\xE3n)"
  intro: "\xD4n ki\u1EC3u chill: tr\u1EA3 l\u1EDDi sai c\u0169ng kh\xF4ng sao. S\xE1ng
    mai tr\xEAn l\u1EDBp m\u1EDBi \"h\u01A1i\" g\u1EAFt h\u01A1n."
  questions:
  - prompt: "[\xD4n ch\u01A1i \u2014 ng\xE0y 8] Khi b\u1EA1n h\u1ECDc nh\xF3m online,
      bi\u1EBFn c\u1ED1 n\xE0o hay nh\u1EA5t?"
    options:
    - "Qu\xEAn unmute khi ch\u1EEDi \u0111\u1EC1"
    - "Share nh\u1EA7m m\xE0n h\xECnh tab shopping"
    - Cat walk qua keyboard
    - "T\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 \u0111\u1EC1u oscar-worthy"
    correctIndex: 3
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[\xD4n ch\u01A1i \u2014 ng\xE0y 8] Ch\u1ECDn 'power-up' th\u1EF1c t\u1EBF
      nh\u1EA5t:"
    options:
    - "N\u01B0\u1EDBc + ng\u1EE7 \u0111\u1EE7 + chia nh\u1ECF vi\u1EC7c"
    - "N\u01B0\u1EDBc t\u0103ng l\u1EF1c v\u1ECB\u2026 lo l\u1EAFng"
    - Podcast 3x speed
    - "\u0110\u1ED5i avatar th\xE0nh mode serious"
    correctIndex: 0
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[\xD4n ch\u01A1i \u2014 ng\xE0y 8] T\u1ED1i nay b\u1EA1n x\u1EE9ng \u0111\xE1ng
      reward n\xE0o (vui)?"
    options:
    - "1 t\u1EADp phim 'd\xE0i 5 ph\xFAt'"
    - "Scroll 10 ph\xFAt (40 ph\xFAt)"
    - "\u0102n m\xF3n y\xEAu th\xEDch"
    - "T\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 \u2014 theo ch\u1EBF \u0111\u1ED9 'balance'"
    correctIndex: 2
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[\xD4n ch\u01A1i \u2014 ng\xE0y 8] M\u1ED9t c\xE2u 'kinh \u0111i\u1EC3n'
      tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi thi l\xE0 g\xEC?"
    options:
    - "\xD4i d\u1EC5 m\xE0 (nghe alarm trong \u0111\u1EA7u)"
    - "Ch\u1EC9 c\u1EA7n \u0111\u1ECDc l\u1EA1i ph\u1EA7n\u2026 to\xE0n b\u1ED9"
    - "T\u1EE5i n\xF3 c\u0169ng ch\u01B0a h\u1ECDc (t\u1EE5i n\xF3 h\u1ECDc r\u1ED3i)"
    - "M\xECnh \u1ED5n (\u0111ang kh\xF4ng \u1ED5n)"
    correctIndex: 3
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[\xD4n ch\u01A1i \u2014 ng\xE0y 8] Ch\u1ECDn m\u1ED9t 'chi\u1EBFn l\u01B0\u1EE3c'
      \xF4n b\xE0i h\u1EE3p ph\xE1p duy nh\u1EA5t:"
    options:
    - "\u0110\u1ECDc slide tr\xEAn gi\u01B0\u1EDDng cho t\u1EDBi khi... ng\u1EE7"
    - "L\u1EADp mindmap b\u1EB1ng meme"
    - "Gi\u1EA3i th\xEDch b\xE0i cho m\xE8o"
    - "Pomodoro 25p + ngh\u1EC9 6 ti\u1EBFng"
    correctIndex: 0
    explanation: 
